WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
07:00 — Plan on the bus. On the bus Sara opens My Plan on her iPad and confirms today’s 3-day split before she even reaches the basement gym with the unreliable signal.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
07:40 — First warm-up set. Phone logger open on the first warm-up set — kilograms and reps save locally with no cloud spinner, which matters when the Wi-Fi dies mid-session.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
08:15 — Superset done. Still offline for the superset; the rest timer ticks on the phone while she watches the clock on the wall, not an app store login wall.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
20:00 — Sunday charts. Sunday evening she opens the laptop progress chart and smiles at three finished sessions — volume up gently, ego left outside.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
20:30 — Next week tweak. She nudges next week’s load on My Plan from the laptop, then closes the lid. The basement will still be offline. The log will still work.

